Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.62,0:00:04.36,main,Carol,0,0,0,,What time are you coming \Nover on our next day off?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.84,0:00:08.03,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Misuzu? When did you make plans to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.03,0:00:10.64,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I didn't. I thought she meant you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.64,0:00:12.86,main,Carol,0,0,0,,'Cause that's the first \Ntime I've mentioned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.71,0:00:34.01,italics,OP,0,0,0,,When I throw a jab or a straight,\N it always lands
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.01,0:00:39.14,italics,OP,0,0,0,,But when I'm aiming for your heart,\N I miss every time
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.14,0:00:44.48,italics,OP,0,0,0,,Parallel, zigzagging, awkward, incoherent
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.48,0:00:48.98,italics,OP,0,0,0,,When you look my way and move closer to me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.98,0:00:54.74,italics,OP,0,0,0,,I know it doesn't mean the same thing for you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.74,0:00:59.78,italics,OP,0,0,0,,But I wish we could stay like this forever
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.78,0:01:05.91,italics,OP,0,0,0,,My changing feelings are driving me crazy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.91,0:01:11.21,italics,OP,0,0,0,,The moment you turn to face me,\N take that! Telepathy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.21,0:01:16.68,italics,OP,0,0,0,,If only we could feel the same thing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.68,0:01:21.56,italics,OP,0,0,0,,I want to kick this pesky subtlety away
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.56,0:01:27.56,italics,OP,0,0,0,,I want to know everything, \NI want to know everything
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.56,0:01:30.11,italics,OP,0,0,0,,I can't fool you forever
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.11,0:01:32.73,italics,OP,0,0,0,,I can't keep this hidden
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.73,0:01:37.49,italics,OP,0,0,0,,I want to shout out my secret, AHHH
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.41,0:01:41.95,italics,OP,0,0,0,,Take that! Telepathy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.95,0:01:44.41,italics,OP,0,0,0,,Te-te-te-telepathy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.12,0:01:47.50,italics,OP,0,0,0,,Telepathy
