Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.84,0:01:57.34,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Carol really didn't put much thought \Ninto this map she gave us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.34,0:01:59.93,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I'm not sure if I'd even call it a map.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.93,0:02:02.10,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,It should be around here,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.10,0:02:04.72,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,but there's nothing but a \Nfence with no end in sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.39,0:02:07.52,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I wonder if it's some sort of facility.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.73,0:02:15.48,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,It's... not here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.48,0:02:17.28,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I really want to hope it isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.61,0:02:20.20,main,Carol's Mom,0,0,0,,Oh! You two!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.57,0:02:25.33,main,Carol's Mom,0,0,0,,What are you doing just standing \Nin front of my house?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.33,0:02:27.12,main,Carol's Mom,0,0,0,,Are you bad people?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.62,0:02:29.04,italics,Misuzu,0,0,0,,No mistaking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.04,0:02:31.50,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,They're definitely related.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.04,0:02:35.50,main,Carol's Mom,0,0,0,,You're Carol-chan's friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.80,0:02:37.63,main,Carol's Mom,0,0,0,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.97,0:02:40.59,main,Carol's Mom,0,0,0,,Especially you, the tall one!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.59,0:02:43.05,main,Carol's Mom,0,0,0,,You don't have any perverted intentions?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.05,0:02:44.10,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.10,0:02:48.48,main,Carol's Mom,0,0,0,,I know that all boys are...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.68,0:02:50.48,main,Carol's Mom,0,0,0,,Oh. Breasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.60,0:02:55.48,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Um... For what it's worth, \NI'm actually a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.78,0:02:59.61,main,Carol's Mom,0,0,0,,Oh, okay! Come on in!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.53,0:03:01.95,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I want to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.95,0:03:05.37,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Don't leave! I can't handle this on my own!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.87,0:03:08.79,main,Carol's Mom,0,0,0,,The path to our house is like a maze,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.79,0:03:11.04,main,Carol's Mom,0,0,0,,so make sure you follow me closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.33,0:03:14.04,main,Carol's Mom,0,0,0,,Even I get lost sometimes, but still...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.04,0:03:14.67,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.29,0:03:17.92,main,Carol's Mom,0,0,0,,I'm sure it will be just fine today!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.05,0:03:22.93,main,Carol's Mom,0,0,0,,At least, I sure hope it will be!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.55,0:03:25.05,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,I'm having all of the bad feelings...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.05,0:03:27.14,italics,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Maybe I really should go home...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.35,0:03:32.81,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Welcome back, Mummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.81,0:03:35.27,main,Carol's Mom,0,0,0,,I'm home, Carol-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.36,0:03:40.11,main,Carol's Mom,0,0,0,,I miss you so much! I love you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.36,0:03:41.15,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.53,0:03:43.91,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Yay! Tomo-chan's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.91,0:03:44.66,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.66,0:03:47.53,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming! You too, Misuzu-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.91,0:03:48.83,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Thank—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.08,0:03:51.21,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Harsh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.33,0:03:53.12,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.75,0:03:56.46,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Look! We have matching braids!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.76,0:04:06.35,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Meanie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.52,0:04:13.73,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Wh-What {\i1}is{\i0} this place?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.10,0:04:15.77,main,Carol,0,0,0,,It's my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.77,0:04:18.19,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,What are you? A princess?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.19,0:04:20.03,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Are you a princess?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.23,0:04:21.78,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Huh? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.78,0:04:24.20,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.03,0:04:24.86,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Would you calm down?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.86,0:04:26.53,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,She's just really rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.08,0:04:30.49,main,Carol,0,0,0,,This is me when I was little.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.83,0:04:32.29,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.29,0:04:34.79,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,You've always worn ribbons \Nin your hair, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.79,0:04:36.71,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Yep. Mummy used to say
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.00,0:04:39.00,main,Carol,0,0,0,,that I'm pudding.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.00,0:04:39.75,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.13,0:04:41.17,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Pudding.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.92,0:04:45.97,main,Carol,0,0,0,,That's why I always wear soft, cute clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.97,0:04:49.10,main,Carol,0,0,0,,The ribbon is the cherry, \Nand you can't forget the cherry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.10,0:04:51.47,main,Carol,0,0,0,,But the most important thing is...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.47,0:04:53.14,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Not letting anyone eat you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.39,0:04:54.31,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.31,0:04:57.69,main,Carol,0,0,0,,How'd you know? Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.65,0:05:00.82,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I'm going to use your bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.23,0:05:03.03,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Sure. It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.03,0:05:05.61,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I saw it on the way in. I can find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.88,0:05:22.63,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.09,0:05:25.22,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Is there something you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.22,0:05:29.09,main,Carol's Mom,0,0,0,,You were mean to Carol-chan earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.47,0:05:31.56,main,Carol's Mom,0,0,0,,Are you actually a bad girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.51,0:05:34.48,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,That's what this is about?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.27,0:05:42.94,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,If I said I'm friends with \Nher for her money...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.73,0:05:46.07,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,What would you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.41,0:05:54.29,main,Carol's Mom,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. You're a very cute girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.29,0:05:55.45,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Uh, thanks...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.87,0:06:00.21,italics,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Why do I feel like I just lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.71,0:06:03.13,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Tomo-chan, let's play Othello.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.38,0:06:05.71,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Sure! I won't go easy on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.71,0:06:07.80,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll be white.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.30,0:06:10.76,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\an7\fscx100\fscy100\p1\pos(-1,-80)\bord4\shad0\3c&H071A2B&\c&HF2FBFC&}m 202 266 l 203 335 437 336 437 265
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.30,0:06:10.76,sign_10511_94_5_Minutes_Later,Text,0,0,0,,{\fscy200\pos(320,243)}5 Minutes Later
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.60,0:06:15.47,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Oh, Othello?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.48,0:06:19.90,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,My Misuzu here is really \Ngood at this kind of game!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.90,0:06:20.90,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,You'd better be ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.44,0:06:24.48,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Well, it's true that I don't often lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.48,0:06:26.53,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll be white.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.94,0:06:29.41,Default,Text,0,0,0,,{\an7\fscx100\fscy100\p1\pos(-1,-80)\bord4\shad0\3c&H071A2B&\c&HF2FBFC&}m 202 266 l 203 335 437 336 437 265
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.94,0:06:29.41,sign_10511_94_5_Minutes_Later,Text,0,0,0,,{\fscy200\pos(320,243)}10 Minutes Later
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.83,0:06:35.16,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,What kind of mother and daughter {\i1}are{\i0} you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.16,0:06:37.33,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Huh? What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.12,0:06:40.29,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Bye, Carol.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.62,0:06:42.00,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,See you at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.00,0:06:43.50,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Thank you for having us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.63,0:06:47.46,main,Carol's Mom,0,0,0,,Please come visit again sometime!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.09,0:06:49.38,main,Carol's Mom,0,0,0,,And you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.13,0:06:51.89,main,Carol's Mom,0,0,0,,Come by again!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.89,0:06:52.80,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.51,0:06:55.01,main,Carol's Mom,0,0,0,,And last is...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.01,0:06:56.97,main,Carol's Mom,0,0,0,,Carol-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.27,0:06:58.39,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Mummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.10,0:07:00.06,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.81,0:07:04.19,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.49,0:07:14.16,sign_3603_13_I_Want_to_Be_See,Title,0,0,0,,{\fad(515,1)\frz-5.29\fsp1\pos(330,160)}A Fe{\3c&H5A5659&\c&HEBEBEB&}eling I Won't {\c&H5A5659&\3c&HEBEBEB&}Give Up
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.86,0:07:12.57,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,"A Feeling I Won't Give Up."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.33,0:07:16.95,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Hey, Misuzu, did you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.95,0:07:19.04,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,We have midterms tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.87,0:07:22.88,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I'm more shocked that \Nyou asked me if I knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.88,0:07:26.67,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I completely forgot! I'm in so much trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.67,0:07:29.05,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,In that case, let's have \Na study group today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.05,0:07:32.01,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Really? Don't you have to study, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.01,0:07:35.18,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I don't mind. We can do it at my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.43,0:07:37.97,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Can I come, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.52,0:07:42.27,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Sure, I guess...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.27,0:07:43.85,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.85,0:07:45.02,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Stop talking like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.11,0:07:47.23,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Tomo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.52,0:07:49.82,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Let's study together after school.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.82,0:07:51.36,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,I'll be your tutor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.36,0:07:52.49,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.91,0:07:56.08,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,You'll tutor Tomo, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.08,0:07:57.53,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Don't be so full of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.53,0:07:58.33,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.79,0:08:02.25,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,What was your ranking in our \Nlast middle school exam?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.25,0:08:05.29,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Huh? I think I ranked around 30.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.75,0:08:07.13,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.59,0:08:11.09,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I ranked... number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.42,0:08:14.26,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.39,0:08:19.85,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I'm kinda surprised, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.35,0:08:21.35,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.35,0:08:26.65,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Well, you usually try to get \Nme and Jun together, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.65,0:08:28.36,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,So why this ti—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.57,0:08:33.32,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I'm allowed every now \Nand then, too, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.41,0:08:36.32,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Do that to me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.32,0:08:37.41,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.95,0:08:41.50,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I haven't been here in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.50,0:08:43.79,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,It looks pretty different in here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.79,0:08:46.08,main,Carol,0,0,0,,You haven't been here very much, either?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.08,0:08:49.42,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,When we were kids, she told \Nme not to come to her house.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.42,0:08:51.51,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I don't remember why, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.21,0:08:54.01,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,You don't remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.76,0:08:57.68,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,It's because you kept breaking \Neverything in my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.68,0:09:00.39,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Oh... Th-That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.39,0:09:03.60,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,You just weren't the kind of child \Nthat could play sitting down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.60,0:09:05.77,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Even today, I'm actually super worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.77,0:09:07.81,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,C'mon, that's not gonna \Nbe a problem anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.27,0:09:10.40,main,Misuzu's Mom,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.44,0:09:14.61,main,Misuzu's Mom,0,0,0,,Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.32,0:09:16.95,main,Misuzu's Mom,0,0,0,,Misuzu has a boyfriend?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.66,0:09:19.62,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.62,0:09:20.99,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.99,0:09:22.12,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm here to visit!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.12,0:09:23.20,main,Misuzu's Mom,0,0,0,,Akemi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.20,0:09:25.83,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Uh, no, I'm her daughter...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.83,0:09:26.96,main,Misuzu's Mom,0,0,0,,Tomo-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.67,0:09:30.84,main,Misuzu's Mom,0,0,0,,You do look just like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.84,0:09:33.05,main,Misuzu's Mom,0,0,0,,But don't grow up to {\i1}be{\i0} like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.05,0:09:34.17,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Uh-huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.17,0:09:37.47,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you. My name is Carol.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.47,0:09:39.68,main,Misuzu's Mom,0,0,0,,Most people don't get this close \Nwhen meeting for the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.01,0:09:42.39,main,Carol,0,0,0,,You look just as cute as Misuzu-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.02,0:09:46.39,main,Misuzu's Mom,0,0,0,,I'm not sold on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.39,0:09:47.44,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Aw...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.44,0:09:48.35,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I'm not, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.35,0:09:50.02,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Aw...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.02,0:09:53.57,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I don't get this at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.90,0:09:56.95,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,It's just a long equation. It's not hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.95,0:09:59.62,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Let's walk through it a step at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.62,0:10:02.95,main,Carol,0,0,0,,It's √10/2-√2, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.24,0:10:05.04,main,Tomo/Misuzu,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.79,0:10:07.75,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.75,0:10:09.00,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,For real?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.21,0:10:12.67,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,It's an easy problem, but not one you \Nshould be able to do in your head...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.67,0:10:13.75,main,Carol,0,0,0,,I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.75,0:10:15.46,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Are you some kinda genius?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.67,0:10:16.92,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,How'd you do that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.92,0:10:20.30,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Well, these ones here are friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.30,0:10:23.85,main,Carol,0,0,0,,so if you whip this around here \Nand smoosh it onto here...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.85,0:10:25.68,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,If math could be solved \Nthat way, anyone could...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.85,0:10:28.10,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Whoa, that's amazing! It worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.10,0:10:28.73,main,Carol,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.73,0:10:31.02,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Oh, man! I might be a genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.02,0:10:32.65,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Tomo-chan the genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.94,0:10:35.23,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I don't know what you did,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.23,0:10:38.61,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,but in math, the process is \Nas important as the solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.61,0:10:41.12,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,You won't get credit if you \Ncan't show your work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.12,0:10:42.41,main,Carol,0,0,0,,What a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.41,0:10:45.37,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,You said it! That's so inefficient!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.21,0:10:51.29,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Okay! Now I'm ready to get serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.29,0:10:52.84,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.29,0:10:57.42,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,There's a lot going on here, \Nso you can express all this as x.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.42,0:10:59.30,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Oh, you're right! That's much better!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.30,0:11:01.76,main,Carol,0,0,0,,You're a good teacher, Misuzu-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.76,0:11:05.10,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,You really are. You've got a knack for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.10,0:11:06.85,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I'd say this much is just normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.85,0:11:08.64,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Don't be so modest!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.64,0:11:11.27,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I mean, you're good enough \Nto make {\i1}me{\i0} understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.73,0:11:13.65,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,If I can keep this up,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.65,0:11:16.98,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I might actually be able to go \Nto the same university as you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.07,0:11:19.24,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,You want to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.45,0:11:21.45,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Of course I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.45,0:11:23.91,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I was barely able to follow \Nyou into this high school,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.91,0:11:25.70,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,so it might not be easy,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.20,0:11:28.29,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,but you're my best friend, after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.17,0:11:32.42,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.25,0:11:38.26,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Okay, okay. You can follow me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.72,0:11:46.56,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Heck yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.22,0:11:50.52,sign_18613_221_70__Aizawa_Tomo,Text,0,0,0,,70 • Aizawa Tomo
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.56,0:11:48.02,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I'm number 70!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.02,0:11:50.52,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,That's the first time I've \Never ranked in the top half!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.52,0:11:53.35,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Looks like you were in good shape this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.35,0:11:55.48,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Yeah! What was your rank?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.48,0:11:56.86,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,I got 54!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.86,0:11:58.19,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Not bad, not great.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.19,0:11:59.86,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,You're so boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.86,0:12:06.03,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Most people don't do stuff like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.03,0:12:07.91,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Well, {\i1}he{\i0} does.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.37,0:12:11.21,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,What was your rank, Misuzu?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.21,0:12:12.12,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Second.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.12,0:12:14.25,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Wow, I should've expected as much!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.25,0:12:16.13,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Who was number one?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.88,0:12:17.09,sign_18613_221_70__Aizawa_Tomo,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1)}1 • Carol Olston
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.13,0:12:27.93,sign_3603_13_I_Want_to_Be_See,Title,0,0,0,,{\fad(515,1)\fscx80\an1\pos(235,140)}Heart-Pounding{\3c&H5A5659&\c&HEBEBEB&}!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.13,0:12:27.93,sign_3603_13_I_Want_to_Be_See,Title,0,0,0,,{\fad(515,1)\an8\fscx80\pos(320,219)}A Gaming Overnighter
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.64,0:12:27.10,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,"Heart-Pounding! A Gaming Overnighter."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.51,0:12:31.89,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,I bought that game you said \Nyou were interested in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.89,0:12:33.14,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,{\i1}Winners Eleven{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.14,0:12:35.60,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Oh, nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.60,0:12:38.77,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,My parents almost never buy me video games.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.77,0:12:43.32,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, when we first met,\N you were a gamer kid, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.53,0:12:46.62,flashback,Tomo,0,0,0,,Hey, gamer kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.46,0:12:55.37,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,That takes me back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.38,0:12:58.71,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Hey, cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.46,0:13:01.67,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Never call me that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.67,0:13:03.92,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Wh-What's with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.18,0:13:11.18,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Wanna come over today?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.18,0:13:13.73,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,We'll do some gaming together,\N like we used to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.73,0:13:14.94,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Really?! I can?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.94,0:13:16.77,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Of course you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.10,0:13:19.77,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,There's no school tomorrow, \Nso you can even stay over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.77,0:13:22.03,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,We can play games until super late!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.03,0:13:24.24,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,A gaming overnighter, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.53,0:13:26.07,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.66,0:13:30.95,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I was so distracted by gaming,\N I didn't realize!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.24,0:13:34.66,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I'm spending the night at Jun's house!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.00,0:13:37.12,italics,Misuzu,0,0,0,,There's all sorts of gaming going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.33,0:13:40.50,main,Carol,0,0,0,,So... can I come, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.50,0:13:43.05,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,You'll go with me, Carol?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.55,0:13:46.01,main,Carol,0,0,0,,This is a thing I shouldn't go to, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.01,0:13:48.59,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,If you know that, don't complicate things.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.84,0:13:50.35,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,No! I shouldn't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.76,0:13:51.85,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I'm gonna tell him no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.06,0:13:53.64,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Wait, Tomo-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.93,0:13:55.23,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.23,0:13:56.60,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.60,0:13:58.35,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Don't ask why. Just sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.06,0:14:00.65,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Just sit, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.23,0:14:03.23,main,Carol,0,0,0,,You telling him no...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.23,0:14:04.57,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,...is not an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.82,0:14:08.99,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,It's only at times like this \Nthat they get along.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.70,0:14:11.91,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Tomo! Walk home with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.95,0:14:14.37,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Jun!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.66,0:14:18.42,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I'm, uh... walking with \NMisuzu and Carol today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.42,0:14:21.46,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Oh, okay. I'll wait for you at home, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.46,0:14:23.17,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,S-Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.68,0:14:31.93,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Fighting it is useless. \NYou're seeing him later anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.93,0:14:33.60,main,Carol,0,0,0,,Yeah, at his house.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.52,0:14:39.06,main,Misuzu,0,0,0,,Going home separately actually seems \Nlike a tease. Almost as if...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.06,0:14:40.02,main,Carol,0,0,0,,As if?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.02,0:14:42.86,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Oh, just shut up, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.02,0:14:46.32,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I'm gonna stay over at Jun's house tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.78,0:14:47.65,main,Akemi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.15,0:14:50.03,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.03,0:14:53.95,main,Akemi,0,0,0,,I see. I thought we still \Nhad a lot more time...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.58,0:14:57.50,main,Akemi,0,0,0,,But maybe it's time to start considering it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.50,0:14:58.16,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.87,0:15:00.33,main,Akemi,0,0,0,,My grandchild's name.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.33,0:15:02.50,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,You're jumping {\i1}way{\i0} ahead here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.88,0:15:05.42,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Dad! I'm staying over at Jun's tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.55,0:15:11.34,main,Goro,0,0,0,,Okay. Don't make too much trouble for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.89,0:15:12.85,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.89,0:15:16.35,main,Goro,0,0,0,,What's the problem? You can go on over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.94,0:15:23.77,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,It's actually kinda unsettling that \Nthey're not concerned at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.52,0:15:26.23,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for you, Tomo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.90,0:15:29.82,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Mom told me to bring you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.82,0:15:33.28,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Cool, thanks! I'll let my mom know tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.28,0:15:34.12,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.37,0:15:36.91,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Yeah. She's not home today.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.37,0:15:39.75,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Went on a trip, apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.75,0:15:42.58,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell me that sooner?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.58,0:15:45.46,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Huh? Did you need to talk \Nto my mom or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.46,0:15:47.92,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,That's not the issue here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.42,0:15:51.80,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,You make such awesome curry, Jun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.22,0:15:53.93,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I'll make some for you sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.93,0:15:55.47,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.47,0:15:59.22,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Every now and then... I do \Nwant to try your cooking.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.22,0:16:02.81,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Really? Well, whenever you\N want some, just ask!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.81,0:16:03.52,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.36,0:16:06.36,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Anyway, what do you wanna \Ndo about your bath?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.36,0:16:09.03,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Hmm... I usually take mine at night, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.99,0:16:12.53,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I was planning to bathe here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.99,0:16:15.45,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Go ahead and take yours after \Nwe're done eating, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.82,0:16:18.41,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,I wanna keep gaming right up until bedtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.41,0:16:21.00,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,O-Okay... I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.25,0:16:24.75,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,I just had mine, so you can just \Nreheat the water and get right in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.21,0:16:30.63,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I'll just take a shower!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.63,0:16:33.63,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Why? A good, long soak will warm you—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.63,0:16:34.76,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Just a shower!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.23,0:16:48.48,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,I'll leave a towel right—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.48,0:16:50.44,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,What?! Did something happen?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.44,0:16:52.70,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,N-No, nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.46,0:17:06.75,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Sorry to make you wait so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.42,0:17:09.00,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,What happened to your cheeks?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.50,0:17:11.55,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,They're all red.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.80,0:17:12.55,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.42,0:17:14.51,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.43,0:17:20.26,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,The mood's so awkward for some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.26,0:17:24.06,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,Is Jun actually conscious of me, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.98,0:17:35.82,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,What can I do? Should I try \Nsaying something to him first?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.41,0:17:37.95,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Okay, Tomo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.32,0:17:39.66,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Let's play that game!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.66,0:17:41.12,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,Wait, what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.91,0:17:45.37,sign_28579_336_FC_VASIMR_,Text,0,0,0,,{\move(180,258,165,265)\fs18\t(1,3460,\fs20)}FC VASIMR
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.91,0:17:45.37,sign_28579_336_FC_VASIMR_,Text,0,0,0,,{\move(370,258,375,265)\fscx90\fs18\t(1,3460,\fs20)}Hill Villagers
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.24,0:17:45.37,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,It's been a long time. \NWant me to go easy on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.62,0:17:47.42,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Get over yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.83,0:17:49.79,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,There! Go! That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.79,0:17:52.59,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,My pass was good! You're wide open!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.59,0:17:55.76,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah! And shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.76,0:17:58.01,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Score!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.51,0:18:03.77,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,You're not half bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.85,0:18:07.23,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,You'll never beat me at video games, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.85,0:18:10.19,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Aw, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.19,0:18:12.40,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,I lost again!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.40,0:18:15.28,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Because you just keep \Nattacking and never defend.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.57,0:18:17.40,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,You need to think about how the game—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.40,0:18:19.24,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Shut up, gamer kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.66,0:18:21.62,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,I told you not to call me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.53,0:18:24.58,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.17,0:18:34.84,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Wanna play another match?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.84,0:18:36.47,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.76,0:18:39.76,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,It's 9:00 already?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.14,0:18:42.85,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,What do you wanna do? Stay up late?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.85,0:18:45.35,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Can you even stay up late?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.35,0:18:49.85,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate me! \NI once stayed up until 11:30!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.85,0:18:52.86,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,That's all? I've...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.65,0:18:56.61,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,stayed up until midnight before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.61,0:18:58.32,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,M-Midnight?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.57,0:19:00.95,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,That's the next day!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.95,0:19:03.16,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,It's not that big a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.62,0:19:05.87,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.33,0:19:08.54,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,we really can't stay up late.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.50,0:19:10.87,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Yeah, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.30,0:19:17.46,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Goodnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.46,0:19:20.05,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Yeah, goodnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.18,0:19:23.80,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,It smells like Jun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.22,0:19:27.89,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,We're really just gonna go to sleep now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.89,0:19:30.89,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,It seems like such a waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.31,0:19:33.15,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,Wait, a waste of what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.69,0:19:34.65,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Tomo?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.32,0:19:36.57,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,You awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.19,0:19:39.32,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.82,0:19:41.86,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Today was fun, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.66,0:19:46.54,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Do you think we're gonna...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.95,0:19:48.50,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,always be like...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.21,0:19:54.54,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Jun, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.50,0:19:59.51,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,That jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.26,0:20:05.64,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,That's what his face looks like?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.64,0:20:07.64,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,I'm always so close to him,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.64,0:20:11.52,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,but I don't get many chances \Nto just look at his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.94,0:20:17.44,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,Especially the little \Ndetails like his ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.11,0:20:20.40,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,Oh, so this is what they look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.82,0:20:21.90,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,What about his nose?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.37,0:20:28.48,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,Oh, crap. This is kinda fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.92,0:20:38.05,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,Wh-What is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.67,0:20:40.38,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,What is going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.63,0:20:41.55,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Jun?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.99,0:21:13.58,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Jun, you sleep in the weirdest positions.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.50,0:21:17.50,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Well, I'm off. See you at the dojo later.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.50,0:21:18.42,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.17,0:21:23.55,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,In spite of everything, that was really fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.55,0:21:25.05,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,I'm glad I came.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.97,0:21:29.01,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,But I feel like I'm forgetting something...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.01,0:21:31.11,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,Last night, I got to Jun's house,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.11,0:21:32.46,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,ate curry,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.46,0:21:33.90,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,took a shower,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.90,0:21:35.23,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,played games,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.23,0:21:36.59,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,went to sleep in the bed...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.35,0:21:42.33,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,and woke up in the futon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.19,0:21:49.00,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,After that, things between us...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.41,0:21:53.76,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.76,0:21:55.22,main,Tomo,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.88,0:21:56.90,main,Junichiro,0,0,0,,Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.91,0:22:08.09,italics,Tomo,0,0,0,,...were like this for about a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.80,0:22:14.56,italics,ED,0,0,0,,(This suspicious behavior is...)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.56,0:22:18.85,italics,ED,0,0,0,,Hey, you know, I'm all mixed up
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.85,0:22:23.32,italics,ED,0,0,0,,It's too complicated, I'm freaking out
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.32,0:22:25.86,italics,ED,0,0,0,,I want to look cute to you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.65,0:22:29.20,italics,ED,0,0,0,,(crazy, crazy, drive me crazy, and that's…)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.86,0:22:28.49,italics,ED,0,0,0,,So I'm plotting, bargaining, \Nsly, and stubborn
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.20,0:22:32.99,italics,ED,0,0,0,,Dizzying love
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.16,0:22:38.58,italics,ED,0,0,0,,Just tell him to look at you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.58,0:22:43.55,italics,ED,0,0,0,,And watch him stiffen up even more, \Nbecause you're both so awkward
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.55,0:22:47.42,italics,ED,0,0,0,,What? Even if we're alike in that way
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.42,0:22:52.01,italics,ED,0,0,0,,It doesn't make me happy, 'cause it\N means our love is going nowhere
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.01,0:23:00.90,italics,ED,0,0,0,,Cloudy heart, swirling emotions—\NI sense rain coming
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.90,0:23:09.99,italics,ED,0,0,0,,So I partly open my umbrella, \Nthen sneakily scoot closer to you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.99,0:23:13.95,italics,ED,0,0,0,,Please notice the curl of my \Neyelashes as I keep blinking
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.95,0:23:18.87,italics,ED,0,0,0,,And don't say I'm acting weird
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.87,0:23:22.84,italics,ED,0,0,0,,All this plotting and bargaining \Nis my sly plan to look cute to you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.84,0:23:27.88,italics,ED,0,0,0,,Try to solve the riddle of \Nthis soft, dizzying love
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.75,0:23:30.01,italics,ED,0,0,0,,(Buzzing, fidgeting)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.26,0:23:34.81,italics,ED,0,0,0,,Listen, I might be a bit \Ntangled in my own web now
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.81,0:23:38.85,italics,ED,0,0,0,,But once you unravel the mystery, \Nyou'll see pure lo-love
